diff --git a/docs/changelog/0.49.md b/docs/changelog/0.49.md
index 6f411ce..f5626a9 100644
--- a/docs/changelog/0.49.md
+++ b/docs/changelog/0.49.md
@@ -1,5 +1,18 @@
 # 0.49 release notes
 
+## [0.49.3]
+
+Cargo metadata execution stays with the repo helper's selected Host. IC Build
+0.23 renders the existing no-dependency, locked/offline command and decodes
+complete JSON through Cargo's canonical schema. The helper admits success and
+completeness before decoding, retains its 4 MiB/64 KiB output limits and reports
+the selected Host's typed failures. No release receipt or runtime format changes.
+
+Interrupted release bootstrap uses a nonempty editor-selection argument array,
+preserving Bash 3.2's nounset contract when release preparation omits `--check`.
+Ordinary helper recovery remains check-only; the selected editor, caller's offline
+setting, retained attempts and release authority are unchanged.
+
 ## [0.49.2] - 2026-10-20
 
 - Select Rust 1.99.1 for development and matching CI checks, retaining existing
